  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 1.5,
      "e": 3.84,
      "text": "- So for the first day we were able to deploy"
    },
    {
      "s": 3.84,
      "e": 6.18,
      "text": "and start executing missions very quickly"
    },
    {
      "s": 6.18,
      "e": 9.4,
      "text": "within the 24-hour timeframe, around 17 hours."
    },
    {
      "s": 9.4,
      "e": 12.43,
      "text": "We had aircraft taking off to conduct rescue missions"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.43,
      "e": 16.12,
      "text": "in the Bahamas while we had other members of our group"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.12,
      "e": 18.8,
      "text": "that were moving equipment, personnel,"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.8,
      "e": 22.53,
      "text": "down to Patrick so we can continually do the operation."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.68,
      "e": 26.14,
      "text": "We had H-60s there on station."
    },
    {
      "s": 26.14,
      "e": 30.92,
      "text": "We had an HC-130J Combat King II aircraft."
    },
    {
      "s": 30.92,
      "e": 34.41,
      "text": "We also had Guardian Angel in the back of the helicopter"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.41,
      "e": 36.47,
      "text": "so by the end of the first 24 hours"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.47,
      "e": 38.82,
      "text": "we had all of our forces at Patrick,"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.82,
      "e": 41.06,
      "text": "at our new location to operate out of."
    },
    {
      "s": 41.06,
      "e": 44.97,
      "text": "We had also been over the Bahamas for over eight hours"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.97,
      "e": 48.58,
      "text": "and saved three people and that day, when we ended,"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.58,
      "e": 50.17,
      "text": "we came back to Patrick"
    },
    {
      "s": 50.17,
      "e": 53.11,
      "text": "and our complete operation was set up here"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.11,
      "e": 55.6,
      "text": "and we were ready to go for the next day"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.6,
      "e": 57.37,
      "text": "with three people already saved."
    }
  ],
